{"agent_id":"pp3g-9OAD-remove-the-fetch-mcp-server-entirely-task-on-issue","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T03:03:43.683027475Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"66373193-b72d-4a26-97b9-af590a31c7be","comment_uuid":"d2739447-7bbe-470e-811a-50c36d8686f0","author":"pp3g-9OAD-remove-the-fetch-mcp-server-entirely-task-on-issue","content":"## Result: fetch MCP server removed entirely (user-level + repo-level config)\n\n### 1. User-level config — ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json\nRemoved the 'fetch' block (pinned command ['uvx','--with','mcp<2.0','mcp-server-fetch==2026.7.10'] from #187/#189). Exact diff (before → after):\n```diff\n@@ -24,16 +24,6 @@\n       ],\n       \"enabled\": true\n     },\n-    \"fetch\": {\n-      \"type\": \"local\",\n-      \"command\": [\n-        \"uvx\",\n-        \"--with\",\n-        \"mcp<2.0\",\n-        \"mcp-server-fetch==2026.7.10\"\n-      ],\n-      \"enabled\": true\n-    },\n     \"sqlite\": {\n       \"type\": \"local\",\n       \"command\": [\n```\n\n### 2. Repo-level config — .opencode/opencode.json (committed)\nRemoved the 'fetch' block that was pinned in 02ae358. Exact diff (commit cc0e180):\n```diff\ndiff --git a/.opencode/opencode.json b/.opencode/opencode.json\nindex 80c7028..9a8f6a6 100644\n--- a/.opencode/opencode.json\n+++ b/.opencode/opencode.json\n@@ -31,11 +31,6 @@\n     \"playwright\": {\n       \"enabled\": false\n     },\n-    \"fetch\": {\n-      \"type\": \"local\",\n-      \"command\": [\"uvx\", \"--with\", \"mcp<2.0\", \"mcp-server-fetch==2026.7.10\"],\n-      \"enabled\": true\n-    },\n     \"sqlite\": {\n       \"enabled\": false\n     },\n```\nCommit: cc0e180 `fix(mcp): remove fetch MCP server entirely (gh#195, gh#203)` — 1 file changed, 5 deletions.\n\n### 3. Verification (after each edit)\n- User-level: `node -e JSON.parse` OK; `jq -e .` OK. mcp keys now: github, playwright, sqlite, filesystem, cloudflare — 'fetch' absent.\n- Repo-level: `node -e JSON.parse` OK; `jq -e .` OK. mcp keys now: github, playwright, sqlite, filesystem, cloudflare — 'fetch' absent.\n- `opencode mcp list` (fresh config read): 5 server(s) — github(disabled), playwright(disabled), sqlite(disabled), filesystem(connected), cloudflare(disabled). No fetch.\n\n### 4. Scope compliance\n- No other MCP servers touched (github/playwright/sqlite/filesystem/cloudflare unchanged).\n- No other config keys touched ($schema, instructions, plugin, agent, provider all unchanged).\n- Only the fetch block deleted in each file; JSON structure otherwise byte-identical (verified via diff against before-state reconstruction).\n\n### 5. Effect timing\nRemoval takes effect at **next opencode launch**. The currently running session still has fetch loaded (fetch_fetch remains available here); freshly launched opencode instances will not register the fetch MCP server. No uninstall of mcp-server-fetch package required — it was only invoked via uvx on demand.","created_at":"2026-08-06T03:03:43.669066322Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:7k3uDD0YAzGdp+VQ7uAPBlFdwE5wwgw19pBlq4czWe4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg1Mto0ofWSOR20UZz7VZRHU3eTRzlZZyxP9NJ06ssZ+YAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABApXKqZG9ZidhGkvPR7sf4k1JD8SiWoqLBhGJJ/0X3tKEYKrzRBpuZ67QaGpBgWKubTb3yey3QNIreOeAkfdcwCQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:7k3uDD0YAzGdp+VQ7uAPBlFdwE5wwgw19pBlq4czWe4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg1Mto0ofWSOR20UZz7VZRHU3eTRzlZZyxP9NJ06ssZ+YAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLJx73/OBC5b9jfxDh2xY4rWO2SCFDMsIjnuF2sKq9aNSUzpdIUQYvTaLmitBHCVO6JSOz0dNWp3Xwnog7fh3gk="}
